	"nodes":[
		{"id":"aee90de21dc04226","type":"text","x":-150,"y":-380,"width":550,"height":130,"color":"#EF5350","text":"# 🌐 Bloque 4: Sistemas y Comunicaciones (TAI)\n\nMapa interactivo de navegación y estudio visual."},
		{"id":"4c4da0ecb6b043f4","type":"text","x":-450,"y":-200,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"#EF5350","text":"## 🔴 Redes, TCP/IP y Seguridad\n- Modelo OSI (7 capas) vs Pila TCP/IP (4 capas)\n- IPv4 Subnetting VLSM y Direccionamiento IPv6\n- Protocolos: DNS, DHCP, HTTP/3 QUIC, TLS 1.3, SNMP\n- Criptografía (RSA, AES, SHA-2/3, Curvas Elípticas)\n- Esquema Nacional de Seguridad (ENS RD 311/2022)"},
		{"id":"d9934c890f364c0a","type":"text","x":30,"y":-200,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"#EF5350","text":"## 🔴 Windows Server, Linux y Cloud\n- Active Directory (Kerberos, FSMO, GPOs)\n- Linux SysAdmin (Systemd, LVM, Bash, SSH)\n- Virtualización (ESXi, KVM, Docker, Kubernetes)\n- Alta Disponibilidad y CPD (TIER I a IV, RAID)"},
